# Keep the published package lean: ship the library, example, and metadata —
# not the contributor tooling.
#
# IMPORTANT: pub uses this file *instead of* .gitignore for this directory,
# not in addition to it. Every root .gitignore rule that should also apply to
# the published archive has to be repeated below — the earlier "additive to
# .gitignore" assumption is why the 0.2.0 archive shipped build/ (two 8 MB
# .dill caches) and coverage/lcov.info.

# --- Mirrors .gitignore (see note above) ---
.dart_tool/
.packages
build/
coverage/
pubspec.lock
.DS_Store
workspaces/

# --- Contributor tooling: not needed to consume the library ---
playground/
docs-site/
docs/
tool/
test/
.github/
Taskfile.yml

# The Flutter/plugin-dependent transport is its own package (`publish_to:
# none`), consumed by apps through a path dependency — never resolved from
# this archive, so shipping it here is dead weight.
webview/

# koni_dojo_icon.png is deliberately NOT excluded: README.md embeds it with a
# relative path, which pub.dev resolves against the archive.
